 no mercy in the cursed woods\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#\n偷猎者帕利亚\n#{normal}#94 - 118#{italic}#\n在受诅咒的森林中，无人手下留情\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea56a1e70f437ba48b5a4271701985675b8cc88b07982d6995396e0e41a3c99a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd733502ee3dfac4943703a699e9b2f8dd1801df26c395beb8555bea57e9660e","logical_entry_identity":"d45eb8380d5c539a85c5685839b62494c0d8d499faf0ee136ac286c6f6d1cfff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attack up to three adjacent targets for %d%% weapon damage.  If any attack hits you'll create a temporal shear dealing %0.2f temporal damage in a radius %d cone.\n\t\tEach target you hit with your weapons beyond the first increases the damage of the shear by 25%%.  Targets reduced below 20%% of maximum life by the shear may be instantly slain.\n\t\tThe cone damage improves with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"攻击至多三个相邻目标，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。只要任意一次攻击命中，就会制造一道时空切变，造成 %0.2f 时空伤害，范围为半径 %d 的锥形区域。\n\t\t从第二个武器命中的目标起，每多命中一个目标，切变伤害便提高 25%%。被切变伤害降至最大生命值 20%% 以下的目标可能会被立即杀死。\n\t\t锥形伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"112f02b0cc24293450d6ff5a5c19b55cc068a188e90ca55578c19f2fb375ba99","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd78a54ff2c3efab8cd495745e29b05a6f010493895730e760b00df9ce408ddc","logical_entry_identity":"5e186cb3fc150f6b50d5480ff4ab37df9faf72ace0c406bdcd0d31d69145fd6f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Oh, sorry, I was not myself. Goodbye, then. Farewell.","source_tag":"_t","target":"噢，对不起，我刚才失态了。那么，再见吧。保重。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"76c7be13f7620871b8e030714385cf7ecad3b655d74e775d539ce6e45da04513","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd7d1de3cd9329762a03a2274b1416ede70cdcb2fe1d5b165430d37af7f18399","logical_entry_identity":"98f0d042684fff3386ee75dd81bed29d1d77bab46832ac3ea23dc2831a96f119","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sing a song of violence and victory (mostly violence) and sustain yourself through cruelty.\nEach time you deal a critical strike you gain 10%% of a turn (only once per turn).\nEach time you kill a creature you gain %d%% of a turn (only once per turn).\n","source_tag":"tformat","target":"唱一首关于暴力与胜利的歌（主要是暴力），以残酷来维持自身。\n你每次暴击时获得 10%% 个回合的时间（每回合限一次）。\n你每次杀死一个生物时获得 %d%% 个回合的时间（每回合限一次）。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dd49cc99d04ff35367dff9572bbf7b85c67522ee5f9044bc51cca467c84c67b4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd856124a3a72c25190081f07ec2c7ad3993d2544e9ec0de5909058bd9936bdc","logical_entry_identity":"3050a780daa4c1f5c7077558b7a6c845a04b79d73c185f17d398a3381dc6b5b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This is terrible! What is happening to me?!? You must help me!","source_tag":"_t","target":"太可怕了！我这是怎么了？！你一定要帮帮我！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7194014369668ed2e962830d3551454d7c2cbc1b7c5e79dba70c0643aef4162f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd887fae2bb5baa53d9d40820854b902c407e07d51c094de8892eb180dcda495","logical_entry_identity":"3c54f063e499c5f45394cd1d645ff3d55ca53d6e443caa9e02de7d66cce81e93","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Matter is energy","source_tag":"_t","target":"物能转化"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"caf28626b3a79c69d1be56f1d96bc73198278b4e9238bb946302944f0f0fc9b9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8abcb10188c62b6d4802d3ab05f4b06a5e36c37ecf6c7619bb91062db3b247","logical_entry_identity":"224b5b13aa68f0c1dba274f9419f3b32ad174df8b253aa253ac7ff7e0e493a53","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Source@ creates a sphere of destruction.","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Source@制造了毁灭之球。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"937442d8695ac0ea364756e0e08c1fc01068da008a324a69dd27d7b2340f54d5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8ac15d93361734072b4988cd4c13f9aeba6075e724635d712f37a76fdd9867","logical_entry_identity":"ae0909fb3c2172090428b066c85b6f65f4545c17bf9f4681208ea0050d1cf9c3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" All blocked damage heals the wielder.","source_tag":"_t","target":" 所有格挡的伤害值会治疗玩家。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fe12ba44ed6a90ad9c74df4a75c8bf0843fc4b23adcb3682164d3c3941b40889","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8acd249ee5e38c9b16caa3899cf056a0db0c3b772ad03f520fd0392334f998","logical_entry_identity":"f8ba36a2b5d146ee60145168399c2ef381a49ce323e247fe729003a85b89c437","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deals %0.2f physical damage and pins, slows (30%%), and wounds for an additional %0.2f damage over 5 turns).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%0.2f 物理伤害，定身、30%% 减速，5回合额外 %0.2f 流血伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3140455ab4d0bf2b59549c2bbfd23e6f12bce183b8acf0a6c247b31ce1cf65d0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8ce04f94228b385bef86c4ea628a436115dd5506dd8d92c88412bc0f0f79e2","logical_entry_identity":"99e7b6c11f310e7938f6219bc443c6455556020c0df671843016d6a7109ce51e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the lobotomy!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了脑叶切除！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc94cc8b91fb2321f1e34bb2d9cd0ccb22794b8938ba9334c8bf51be513e6b9c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8e648b270b895b056fccd244704f0f2a67417148b85dcab18145657cee3ba1","logical_entry_identity":"1afea774331c46e86c5e3510abcfb53243038bd858e5f2e91e82dc1f0b4124c7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Unending Frenzy","source_tag":"talent name","target":"无尽怒火"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"482482044326f3bb903d5da4c7a87096db333a52e6c1d55de2772b75b854f2a3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8e9cf5f36eef276e80a1e642280d54dd6443bb55749790e517dc3b216546f8","logical_entry_identity":"55c6723a7072633071ab4e2e97d88b19c9a9fdd1a44a174c7c2afcbfd1a72c3d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Warriors train in all aspects of physical combat. They can be juggernauts of destruction wielding two-handed greatswords, or massive iron-clad protectors with gleaming shields.","source_tag":"_t","target":"战士精通于各种物理系战斗技能，他们可以手持双手大剑造成成吨的打击，也可以身穿重甲手持盾牌成为一个强大的护卫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa48481ca2d0b5ee733b97138882cffb2ef8cef447f9f7dc01adcb2216a6304a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd8eeac0658c7e05025847990c7776dd1b335cef683932c5b5e1c99d3896612f","logical_entry_identity":"3c1ae230cadaa58e4372132245db021619ac8fea6bbcb82f78a2eec444cc5f73","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dearest Weisman,\n\nSorry to cut your birdwatching session short, but I must bring this badinage to an end. I have tolerated your ridiculous pomposity and false heroics long enough. At first, I took your over-inflated tales of bothering local wildlife with good humour but now I realise, with dread, that you are sincere; you believe your pathetic wanderings to be the stuff of legend.\n\nWell, no more. We shall meet seven days from now in Derth's town square. Come prepared for travel. The number of rumours claiming that a monster has taken up residence within the ruins just north of town have grown to the point where they cannot be considered rumours anymore. You shall come with me, face this creature alongside me, and experience intimately the vast difference between your skills and my own. If we're lucky, you will learn this lesson unscathed, but I fear that such a trial may cost you a limb or two.\n\nPrepare yourself, if you've the courage,\nRolf","source_tag":"_t","target":"最亲爱的威斯曼，\n\n不好意思打断你观赏花鸟，但我必须给你的笑话打上休止符。老子已经忍你很久了。上次我觉得你写的”野生小动物观察日记“还是挺幽默的，慢慢的我惊恐的发现你这家伙是当真的呀。你这可悲的家伙以为自己的郊游是传说级的冒险吗？\n\n好吧，到此为止了，七天后我们在德斯镇见。别忘记为旅行做好准备。最近有传闻说有个怪物占领了城市北方的遗迹，事态的恶化让人们不能单纯的以传闻处之了。你应该随我来，见识一下这只怪物，切身体会一下你和我之间的差距。幸运的话，这次冒险后你能全身而退，但恐怕面对这只怪物会打断你一两条肋骨。\n\n开始准备吧，如果你够胆的话。\n罗尔夫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a7c38a9e43bd95a9806d846f70a702f78696552644f50daa5990fa47e5975b7c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd902a7317c456a903609fb7294413b01c0e1a00013d6da40cf649c8e72453d8","logical_entry_identity":"5cda6a1070f728137cf305b90ebe9588bfe8fa627b9fe16472ab332336a1c4d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Immune to detrimental magical effects","source_tag":"_t","target":"对魔法负面状态免疫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b929e84680a15c5e3755adb9347c12b12cf080ddf30e065f6eb0ae6bdae6001","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd9455b4c43521a0ed6092c87f871c3f15a879444cc383f502a0e2a30fd66281","logical_entry_identity":"2c2966d7599ede703a43bef533ab2d6eaf791a0b44c1cce6072f66a12d836c33","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Greater Weapon Focus","source_tag":"talent name","target":"专注打击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bab9078896c58942023ce95c64a1330420a13fe2c9fbc87efcc633835ddf9af3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd95c055fd46833b9e2929ed88be08c4af1c7c417d465ae350fc8b25eae24fba","logical_entry_identity":"edbd3921a2f9591c5ff7a6664778d645c4410b017085e0c4484429249311f073","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Temporal Guardian","source_tag":"talent type","target":"时空守卫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a901aa7f2191c2779dd81184173aafed436a2558b0ed91ac3e4a0cb9d8aa904b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd97665e2067a6bbd4dbb5bf4e6291627d47001d24d21976825c4d244295800d","logical_entry_identity":"369c81174b59afa8a2a5b32fdc920fd16c5e9043e4e1e31525ea5882926483eb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Crystal Resonance","source_tag":"_t","target":"+水晶共振"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7a9128d2d4db960eadf4f7e00bc23a8f601aa88616f31322e0837d070723f45","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd9ebe972a5f01cfc1f6ec192c4776d4c5f77e257851b4fce83ae2fdb300fa89","logical_entry_identity":"30f15be6f0afa7fa2566dd349a0eeecd8197d7ab52a26b77e0b4fd3ad20c847e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#rng# the Storm Terror","source_tag":"_t","target":"#rng#风暴恐怖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e4d56f62feb892cbe0bd3138ab42e4ac72a8f5cf27c0a22086295e0c63045c12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bda482a9ca4ea5aa00f5d1408b06d81b690d57ef60dc9151d15c34466c0aea50","logical_entry_identity":"d6991b4e8d5d35538f11baf56a7e7bcdddf2fe34a59c7f85504ab5f3560892ec",